# Ignore everything here by default, and name the exceptions.
#
# The blocklist this replaces did not work. It listed the filenames the README
# suggests -- fcm-demo.json, service-account.json -- and a real Firebase project
# arrives as whatever you saved it as: fcm.key, firebase-config.json, or the
# adminsdk name Google generates. Anything not on the list was committed by the
# next `git add -A`.
#
# Guessing what a credential is called is the wrong way round. This directory
# holds a handful of known files and, while anyone is using it, a Firebase
# project's private settings; so ignore by default and list what belongs.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!main.go
!main_test.go
!uniqush-push.conf
!fcm-demo.example.json
!static/
!static/index.html
!static/firebase-messaging-sw.js
